member.summary:
One sensor value — the current (lastValue) or a history point — as a
uniform envelope: value is typed by the sensor type. Boolean, Integer,
Double, Rate → a JSON number/boolean; String → string; TimeSpan → a .NET
round-trip string ("d.hh:mm:ss"); Version → "major.minor.build.revision";
Enum → EnumValueDto; IntegerBar/DoubleBar → BarValueDto;
File → FileValueDto (metadata only — file content is never served).
